# The build context is the whole component; the builder needs only the Go module.
#
# A deny-list, not an opt-in. `*` followed by `!**/*.go` copied only the top-level main.go
# under podman, because an excluded directory is never descended into, and the build failed
# on every package import. A deny-list does not depend on how an engine walks exclusions.
.git*
.agents
.claude
.cursor
.github
.qubership
agent-packages
documentation
helm-templates
dist
static
*.md
*.cmd
*.yml
*.yaml
apm*
LICENSE
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.editorconfig
.lycheeignore
